{
  "_comment": [
    "Deliberately bad data. Hand written, never generated, because most of these",
    "cannot be built from the model that rejects them.",
    "",
    "Each case says where it is supposed to be caught:",
    "  model                 the Pydantic contract itself rejects it",
    "  validate_room_spec    the room validator rejects it (Phase 1)",
    "  commit_revision       the revision writer rejects it (Phase 1)",
    "  cart_build            it must never become a cart line (Phase 1)",
    "  checkout_reconcile    deterministic reconciliation blocks checkout (Phase 1)",
    "  fit_engine            the fit engine must answer unknown (Phase 1)",
    "  order_lookup          payment is never marked confirmed from the handoff (Phase 1)",
    "",
    "schema_valid says whether the payload parses against its contract. A case",
    "with schema_valid true is a business-rule failure, not a shape failure: the",
    "data is well formed and still must be refused."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
